{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國年度音樂盛事《Melon Music Awards》（MMA 2026）今年首度分拆兩日，分別於前、昨天在首爾高尺天空巨蛋舉行，每場招待約1.8萬人。昨日舉行的第二場頒獎禮有女神張元英所屬的人氣女團IVE、ILLIT、KiiiKiii，以及人氣男團CORTIS、NCT 127、NCT WISH等撐場，IVE晒腿亮相紅地氈，明艷照人；而張元英將於今日襲港，參加主題樂園的奇妙聖誕揭幕活動。ILLIT成員Yunah以獨眼龍Look亮相。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:50:17.894238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:15:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T02:03:55.334254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T01:43:43.604492+00:00","content_hash":"fc996219d12f67443f536bf50fbc4fe106c3fac9532e9279e1121142abb9a0c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:50:17.894238+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}